# Q225074e66d38

```modelica
model Study
  Real u;
  Real x(start = 0);
  Real result;
equation
  u = if time < 0.5 then 5 else 9;
  x = sample(u, Clock(1, 1));
  result = hold(x);
end Study;
```

What is the exact value of Study.result immediately after the second clock activation at t = 1 s? Return an integer or a reduced fraction.
